{"unit_id":"chendefine__dsh-sidebar-cdp-browser#caveat-1","repo":"chendefine/dsh-sidebar-cdp-browser","commit":"35ececac5387e60652c72f4e1c05fc00c2ab86ef","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-cdp-browser 使用前须知：DSH 主机必须能访问 Chromium CDP 地址；默认地址为本机 127.0.0.1:9222，空设置会回退到该地址。（见 src/config.ts:16,28-40）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.ts:16","src/config.ts:28-40"]}
